{
 "seconds": 146.535,
 "shots": [
  {
   "id": "alarm",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "room",
   "start": 3.0,
   "end": 9.448,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Every morning, Dex wakes up with a brand-new power.",
     "start": 3.25,
     "end": 6.026
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "This morning, everything looked... big.",
     "start": 6.676,
     "end": 8.948
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pillow",
   "start": 9.448,
   "end": 12.245,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Huh? Why is my pillow a mountain?",
     "start": 9.698,
     "end": 11.645
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "title",
   "start": 12.245,
   "end": 15.586,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Day five. Dex had shrunk!",
     "start": 12.495,
     "end": 14.186
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ruler",
   "start": 15.586,
   "end": 20.517,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "All the way down to about one centimetre tall. Smaller than a sugar cube.",
     "start": 15.836,
     "end": 20.017
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "fun",
   "start": 20.517,
   "end": 22.691,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "And at first? It was amazing.",
     "start": 20.767,
     "end": 22.491
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ride",
   "start": 22.691,
   "end": 25.281,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Free rides across the bedroom.",
     "start": 22.941,
     "end": 24.681
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hide",
   "start": 25.281,
   "end": 28.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "The best hiding place in the world.",
     "start": 25.531,
     "end": 27.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lift",
   "start": 28.0,
   "end": 35.328,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "And for his size, he was super strong.",
     "start": 28.25,
     "end": 30.224
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "When you shrink, your muscles get weaker, but your weight drops much, much faster.",
     "start": 30.574,
     "end": 34.728
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "fall",
   "start": 35.328,
   "end": 41.485,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Then he walked straight off the edge of the bed.",
     "start": 35.578,
     "end": 37.665
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Whoooa!",
     "start": 38.015,
     "end": 38.665
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "I'm okay!",
     "start": 40.215,
     "end": 41.085
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "fallwhy",
   "start": 41.485,
   "end": 46.365,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "When you're this tiny, the air slows you down so much that falling barely hurts.",
     "start": 41.735,
     "end": 45.965
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "haldane",
   "start": 46.365,
   "end": 51.918,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Back in nineteen twenty-six, a scientist called J. B. S. Haldane wrote about this.",
     "start": 46.615,
     "end": 51.618
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mouse",
   "start": 51.918,
   "end": 59.104,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "He said that if you dropped a mouse down a deep mine shaft, it would get a slight shock at the bottom, and then just walk away.",
     "start": 52.168,
     "end": 58.304
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "badnews",
   "start": 59.104,
   "end": 61.459,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "But then came the bad news.",
     "start": 59.354,
     "end": 60.959
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cold",
   "start": 61.459,
   "end": 69.848,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "First, Dex was freezing.",
     "start": 61.709,
     "end": 63.306
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Your body loses heat through your skin. And the smaller you are, the more skin you have, compared to the rest of you.",
     "start": 63.656,
     "end": 69.248
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hungry",
   "start": 69.848,
   "end": 79.854,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "To stay warm, tiny animals have to eat almost all the time. A shrew eats about its own body weight in food, every single day.",
     "start": 70.098,
     "end": 77.306
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "So I'm hungry... forever?",
     "start": 77.656,
     "end": 79.354
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "voice",
   "start": 79.854,
   "end": 85.753,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Next problem. A tiny voice box makes a tiny voice. Very high, and very, very quiet.",
     "start": 80.104,
     "end": 85.253
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mum",
   "start": 85.753,
   "end": 92.055,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "MUM",
     "text": "Dex? Breakfast! Where are you?",
     "start": 86.003,
     "end": 87.788
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Mum! Down here! Mum!",
     "start": 88.138,
     "end": 89.687
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Mum couldn't hear a thing.",
     "start": 90.037,
     "end": 91.455
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "stomp",
   "start": 92.055,
   "end": 95.638,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Nope. Nope, nope, nope.",
     "start": 93.505,
     "end": 95.138
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "breakfast",
   "start": 95.638,
   "end": 97.795,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Next problem: breakfast.",
     "start": 95.888,
     "end": 97.495
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hoop",
   "start": 97.795,
   "end": 100.853,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "One cereal hoop was bigger than he was.",
     "start": 98.045,
     "end": 100.253
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "milk",
   "start": 100.853,
   "end": 104.882,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "So he went for a sip of milk.",
     "start": 101.103,
     "end": 102.8
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Big mistake.",
     "start": 103.45,
     "end": 104.582
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "surface",
   "start": 104.882,
   "end": 112.33,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "To something this small, the top of a drink acts like a stretchy, sticky skin. One drop can grab you, and not let go.",
     "start": 105.132,
     "end": 111.53
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cliff",
   "start": 112.33,
   "end": 118.466,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Haldane wrote about that too. For an insect, going for a drink is as dangerous as leaning over a cliff.",
     "start": 112.58,
     "end": 118.066
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rule",
   "start": 118.466,
   "end": 121.88,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Rule one: never go near drinks.",
     "start": 118.716,
     "end": 120.68
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "found",
   "start": 121.88,
   "end": 127.145,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "MUM",
     "text": "There you are!",
     "start": 122.13,
     "end": 123.245
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "In the end, Mum found him. With a magnifying glass.",
     "start": 123.595,
     "end": 126.545
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "score",
   "start": 127.145,
   "end": 137.861,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "So, is shrinking a good power?",
     "start": 127.395,
     "end": 129.177
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "He's strong, and he can fall from anywhere.",
     "start": 129.527,
     "end": 131.691
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "But he's always cold, always hungry, nobody can hear him, and a drop of milk could trap him.",
     "start": 132.041,
     "end": 137.061
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "next",
   "start": 137.861,
   "end": 146.535,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Tomorrow, Dex wakes up with another brand-new power.",
     "start": 138.111,
     "end": 140.911
    },
    {
     "who": "NARRATOR",
     "text": "Which one should it be? Tell us in the comments!",
     "start": 141.261,
     "end": 143.535
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}